chool years and floors you use Sino-Korean numbers: 사 학년, 사 층. 넷째 is for siblings and order in a list.","contract_en":"","dis":""},{"id":"n00624","kind":"word","ko":"테니스","yo":"","en":"Tennis","pos":"명사","usage":"","contract":"","examples":[{"id":"e00779","ko":"주말에 남편과 테니스를 쳐요.","en":"I play tennis with my husband on weekends.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"테니스","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e00780","ko":"테니스 라켓을 샀어요.","en":"I bought a tennis racket.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"테니스","extra_word":"라켓 = racket","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e09494","ko":"공원 옆에 테니스장이 있어요.","en":"There's a tennis court next to the park.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"테니스","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e09495","ko":"제 친구는 테니스를 정말 잘 쳐요.","en":"My friend plays tennis really well.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"테니스","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""},{"id":"e09496","ko":"테니스는 어려워요? — 아니요, 아주 쉬워요.","en":"Is tennis hard? — No, it's very easy.","speech_level":"해요","cloze":"테니스","extra_word":"","extra_grammar":"","tip":"","tip_en":""}],"pron":"테니쓰","roman":"teniseu","explain":"테니스, 탁구, 골프처럼 공을 치는 운동에는 “치다”를 써요. “하다”도 되지만 “치다”가 더 자연스러워요.","video_url":"","video_title":"","phrases":[],"pron_source":"wiktionary","pron_why":{"ch":[[2,"c","tense2",-1]],"rules":["tense2"],"long":[]},"dict_examples":[],"explain_en":"For sports where you hit a ball, like tennis, table tennis and golf, use 치다 (“hit”). 하다 is possible too, but 치다 sounds more natural.","contract_en":"","dis":""}]